  "title": "Vertiv Introduces Peter Klanian as Channel Chief",
  "summary": "Vertiv (NYSE: VRT), a global provider of critical digital infrastructure and continuity solutions, today announced the appointment of 25-year industry veteran Peter Klanian as vice president for the Vertiv Americas channel. Klanian joined Vertiv earlier this year after spending 13 years with Dell and 12 years at APC. While at APC he launched their channel program and acted as Channel Chief.",
